{'symbol': 'SO', 'date': '2021-11-05 11:01:00', 'title': 'SOUTHERN COMPANY PARTICIPATES IN THE 26TH UN CLIMATE CHANGE CONFERENCE OF THE PARTIES (COP26) IN GLASGOW', 'text': 'ATLANTA, NOV. 5, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- SOUTHERN COMPANY EXECUTIVES ARE PARTICIPATING IN THE 26TH UN CLIMATE CHANGE CONFERENCE OF THE PARTIES IN GLASGOW, SCOTLAND. SOUTHERN COMPANY WAS ONE OF THE FIRST COMPANIES IN ITS INDUSTRY TO SET A LONG-TERM GOAL OF ACHIEVING NET-ZERO GREENHOUSE GAS (GHG) EMISSIONS BY 2050, AS WELL AS AN INTERIM GOAL OF REDUCING GHG EMISSIONS 50% BY 2030, AS COMPARED TO 2007 LEVELS.'}